id=lmi-dualboot-switch
name=K30 Pro Dualboot Switch
version=v0.1
versionCode=1
author=chenpp1999
description=One-key Android -> Linux switch via recovery + one-shot BCB (ADR-0001). The Android boot partition is never modified; any later reboot returns to Android. Press the module Action button (Magisk 27+) to switch. Uses recovery-swap.sh (default: Termux home) and an attested Linux boot image (default: /data/local/lmi-dualboot/boot-m1b-v6.img).
